  - m_Id: 2429337696460812
    m_Localized: "Buy any items \xD7{Value} ({Progress})"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 3166046073766805607
  - m_Id: 2429337696460813
    m_Localized: Mood
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2429337696460814
    m_Localized: Affection
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2429337696460815
    m_Localized: Affection Level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2429337696460816
    m_Localized: Raise {CharacterName}'s {PropName} to {Value} ({Progress})
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 3166046073766805607
  - m_Id: 2429337696460817
    m_Localized: New in Town
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2429337696460818
    m_Localized: Stay here for two days, then play two rounds of a mini-game to unwind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2429337696460819
    m_Localized: Getting Familiar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2429337696460820
    m_Localized: Before leaving this area, win two mini-game rounds and have a chat
      with everyone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2429337696460821
    m_Localized: A Small Gift
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2429337696460822
    m_Localized: Pick out a gift and deliver it, then see how they react.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2429337696460823
    m_Localized: Wait a While
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2429337696460824
    m_Localized: "Linger here a little longer \u2014 you might discover something
      new."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2429337696460825
    m_Localized: Shopping List
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2429337696460826
    m_Localized: Buy something from the shop, and keep a spare on you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2429337696460827
    m_Localized: Settle into town and stay for {Value} days ({Progress})
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 3166046073766805607
  - m_Id: 2429337696460828
    m_Localized: Also win {Value} rounds of the mini-game ({Progress})
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 3166046073766805607
  - m_Id: 2429337704849408
    m_Localized: Win {Value} rounds of the mini-game ({Progress})
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 3166046073766805607
  - m_Id: 2429337704849409
    m_Localized: Have one more conversation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2429337704849410
    m_Localized: Pick out {ItemName} and give it to {CharacterName} ({Progress})
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 3166046073766805607
  - m_Id: 2429337704849411
    m_Localized: Give {ItemName} one more time ({Progress})
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 3166046073766805607
  - m_Id: 2429337704849412
    m_Localized: Find a moment to finish that conversation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2429337704849413
    m_Localized: Finish "{QuestName}" along the way
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 3166046073766805607
  - m_Id: 2429337704849414
    m_Localized: Buy {ItemName} from the shop ({Progress})
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 3166046073766805607
  - m_Id: 2429337704849415
    m_Localized: "Keep {ItemName} \xD7{Value} on hand ({Progress})"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 3166046073766805607
  - m_Id: 2429337704849416
    m_Localized: Build {CharacterName}'s {PropName} up to {Value} ({Progress})
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 3166046073766805607
  - m_Id: 2429337704849417
    m_Localized: Arrival in Town
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2429337704849418
    m_Localized: 'Your first days in town: get your bearings and meet a few people
      along the way.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2429337704849419
    m_Localized: Neighborly Ties
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2429337704849420
    m_Localized: Friendships grow by showing up. Bring a small gift, share some small
      talk.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2429337704849421
    m_Localized: Trying Your Hand
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2429337704849422
    m_Localized: "The town is full of little diversions. Try a few \u2014 win or
      lose, it all counts."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2429337704849423
    m_Localized: Errands and Errand-Runs
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2429337704849424
    m_Localized: Someone has to do the shopping, and someone has to do the walking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2429337704849425
    m_Localized: Days Go On
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2429337704849426
    m_Localized: One task after another, and the days keep going.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
